language design-core version 0.5.
activity AdapterDelivery.
feature AgentProcessAccess.
interface CompatibleMcpTransport.
mode Connected.
message CoreAccepted.
unit CoreBridge.
channel CoreCalls.
contract CoreCallsProtocol.
scenario CoreOutcomeReturned.
scenario CoreRefusalPreserved.
message CoreRefused.
message EvaluateOperation.
functionality ExposeContextResource.
unit ExternalMcpCaller.
unit ExternalSdpToolCore.
functionality ForwardBoundOperation.
actor GovernedAgent.
message InvokeTool.
capability McpAccess.
channel McpToolCalls.
contract McpToolCallsProtocol.
functionality PreserveOutcomeProvenance.
unit ProtocolAdapter.
unit ResultProjection.
container SdpMcpHost.
interface SdpToolApplicationService.
contract ToolOperation.
field ToolOperationAction.
field ToolOperationCheckoutIdentity.
field ToolOperationEvidenceReferences.
field ToolOperationExpectedRevision.
field ToolOperationIdempotencyKey.
field ToolOperationProjectHandle.
field ToolOperationRunIdentity.
contract ToolOutcome.
field ToolOutcomeCoverage.
field ToolOutcomeDisposition.
field ToolOutcomeOperationIdentity.
field ToolOutcomeRevision.
field ToolOutcomeSourceReferences.
message ToolRefused.
message ToolResult.
usecase UseGovernedTools.
functionality ValidateToolEnvelope.
AdapterDelivery addresses ExposeContextResource.
AdapterDelivery addresses ForwardBoundOperation.
AdapterDelivery addresses PreserveOutcomeProvenance.
AdapterDelivery addresses ValidateToolEnvelope.
AdapterDelivery delivers AgentProcessAccess.
AdapterDelivery has implementation-status = planned.
AgentProcessAccess supports UseGovernedTools.
CoreAccepted has message-kind = result.
CoreAccepted replies-to EvaluateOperation.
CoreAccepted upholds ToolOutcome.
CoreBridge consumes SdpToolApplicationService.
CoreBridge owns ForwardBoundOperation.
CoreBridge uses CoreCalls as receiver of CoreAccepted in mode Connected.
CoreBridge uses CoreCalls as receiver of CoreRefused in mode Connected.
CoreBridge uses CoreCalls as sender of EvaluateOperation in mode Connected.
CoreCalls upholds CoreCallsProtocol.
CoreCallsProtocol has completeness = closed.
CoreCallsProtocol permits CoreAccepted.
CoreCallsProtocol permits CoreRefused.
CoreCallsProtocol permits EvaluateOperation.
CoreOutcomeReturned exercises UseGovernedTools.
CoreOutcomeReturned has completeness = closed.
CoreOutcomeReturned illustrates AdapterDelivery.
CoreOutcomeReturned runs-in Connected.
CoreOutcomeReturned step 1 sends InvokeTool from ExternalMcpCaller to ProtocolAdapter via McpToolCalls.
CoreOutcomeReturned step 2 sends EvaluateOperation from CoreBridge to ExternalSdpToolCore via CoreCalls.
CoreOutcomeReturned step 3 sends CoreAccepted from ExternalSdpToolCore to CoreBridge via CoreCalls reply-to 2.
CoreOutcomeReturned step 4 sends ToolResult from ProtocolAdapter to ExternalMcpCaller via McpToolCalls reply-to 1.
CoreRefusalPreserved exercises UseGovernedTools.
CoreRefusalPreserved has completeness = closed.
CoreRefusalPreserved illustrates AdapterDelivery.
CoreRefusalPreserved runs-in Connected.
CoreRefusalPreserved step 1 sends InvokeTool from ExternalMcpCaller to ProtocolAdapter via McpToolCalls.
CoreRefusalPreserved step 2 sends EvaluateOperation from CoreBridge to ExternalSdpToolCore via CoreCalls.
CoreRefusalPreserved step 3 sends CoreRefused from ExternalSdpToolCore to CoreBridge via CoreCalls reply-to 2.
CoreRefusalPreserved step 4 sends ToolRefused from ProtocolAdapter to ExternalMcpCaller via McpToolCalls reply-to 1.
CoreRefused has message-kind = result.
CoreRefused replies-to EvaluateOperation.
CoreRefused upholds ToolOutcome.
EvaluateOperation has message-kind = request.
EvaluateOperation upholds ToolOperation.
ExposeContextResource allocated-to SdpMcpHost in mode Connected.
ExposeContextResource contributes-to AgentProcessAccess.
ExposeContextResource realizes McpAccess.
ExternalMcpCaller uses McpToolCalls as receiver of ToolRefused in mode Connected.
ExternalMcpCaller uses McpToolCalls as receiver of ToolResult in mode Connected.
ExternalMcpCaller uses McpToolCalls as sender of InvokeTool in mode Connected.
ExternalSdpToolCore uses CoreCalls as receiver of EvaluateOperation in mode Connected.
ExternalSdpToolCore uses CoreCalls as sender of CoreAccepted in mode Connected.
ExternalSdpToolCore uses CoreCalls as sender of CoreRefused in mode Connected.
ForwardBoundOperation allocated-to SdpMcpHost in mode Connected.
ForwardBoundOperation contributes-to AgentProcessAccess.
ForwardBoundOperation realizes McpAccess.
GovernedAgent pursues UseGovernedTools.
InvokeTool has message-kind = request.
InvokeTool upholds ToolOperation.
McpAccess requires CompatibleMcpTransport in mode Connected.
McpAccess requires SdpToolApplicationService in mode Connected.
McpToolCalls upholds McpToolCallsProtocol.
McpToolCallsProtocol has completeness = closed.
McpToolCallsProtocol permits InvokeTool.
McpToolCallsProtocol permits ToolRefused.
McpToolCallsProtocol permits ToolResult.
PreserveOutcomeProvenance allocated-to SdpMcpHost in mode Connected.
PreserveOutcomeProvenance contributes-to AgentProcessAccess.
PreserveOutcomeProvenance realizes McpAccess.
ProtocolAdapter consumes CompatibleMcpTransport.
ProtocolAdapter owns ExposeContextResource.
ProtocolAdapter owns ValidateToolEnvelope.
ProtocolAdapter uses McpToolCalls as receiver of InvokeTool in mode Connected.
ProtocolAdapter uses McpToolCalls as sender of ToolRefused in mode Connected.
ProtocolAdapter uses McpToolCalls as sender of ToolResult in mode Connected.
ResultProjection owns PreserveOutcomeProvenance.
SdpMcpHost contains CoreBridge.
SdpMcpHost contains ProtocolAdapter.
SdpMcpHost contains ResultProjection.
SdpMcpHost provides McpAccess.
ToolOperation has completeness = closed.
ToolOperation has-field ToolOperationAction.
ToolOperation has-field ToolOperationCheckoutIdentity.
ToolOperation has-field ToolOperationEvidenceReferences.
ToolOperation has-field ToolOperationExpectedRevision.
ToolOperation has-field ToolOperationIdempotencyKey.
ToolOperation has-field ToolOperationProjectHandle.
ToolOperation has-field ToolOperationRunIdentity.
ToolOperationAction has presence = required.
ToolOperationAction has value-type = text.
ToolOperationCheckoutIdentity has presence = required.
ToolOperationCheckoutIdentity has value-type = text.
ToolOperationEvidenceReferences has presence = required.
ToolOperationEvidenceReferences has value-type = text.
ToolOperationExpectedRevision has presence = required.
ToolOperationExpectedRevision has value-type = text.
ToolOperationIdempotencyKey has presence = required.
ToolOperationIdempotencyKey has value-type = text.
ToolOperationProjectHandle has presence = required.
ToolOperationProjectHandle has value-type = text.
ToolOperationRunIdentity has presence = required.
ToolOperationRunIdentity has value-type = text.
ToolOutcome has completeness = closed.
ToolOutcome has-field ToolOutcomeCoverage.
ToolOutcome has-field ToolOutcomeDisposition.
ToolOutcome has-field ToolOutcomeOperationIdentity.
ToolOutcome has-field ToolOutcomeRevision.
ToolOutcome has-field ToolOutcomeSourceReferences.
ToolOutcomeCoverage has presence = required.
ToolOutcomeCoverage has value-type = text.
ToolOutcomeDisposition has presence = required.
ToolOutcomeDisposition has value-type = text.
ToolOutcomeOperationIdentity has presence = required.
ToolOutcomeOperationIdentity has value-type = text.
ToolOutcomeRevision has presence = required.
ToolOutcomeRevision has value-type = text.
ToolOutcomeSourceReferences has presence = required.
ToolOutcomeSourceReferences has value-type = text.
ToolRefused has message-kind = result.
ToolRefused replies-to InvokeTool.
ToolRefused upholds ToolOutcome.
ToolResult has message-kind = result.
ToolResult replies-to InvokeTool.
ToolResult upholds ToolOutcome.
ValidateToolEnvelope allocated-to SdpMcpHost in mode Connected.
ValidateToolEnvelope contributes-to AgentProcessAccess.
ValidateToolEnvelope realizes McpAccess.
